<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:58:29.810 --> 00:58:38.920
<v Ira Glass>If you'd like a copy of our program, call us at 312-832-3380 here in Chicago at WBEZ. Our email address, [email protected] .
<v Ira Glass>如果你想要一份节目副本，请致电我们在芝加哥WBEZ的电话312-832-3380。我们的电子邮箱是[email protected]。

00:58:38.920 --> 00:58:48.230
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资金鸣谢]

00:58:48.230 --> 00:58:53.230
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带给你更多《美国生活》的故事。
